                <head>No. 235.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-09-06"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 6,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary,
                        Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Treaty postponed for further deliberation,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
